      "title": "Finite-block dependence balance and limits of coarse entropy relaxation",
      "summary": "Program for exact finite-block and selected-coordinate constraints from reliable private-message broadcast codes and for the capabilities and limitations of a specified coarse BSSC entropy relaxation. Its attained value 2h₂(1/4)−5/4 supplies no capacity bound within this program, despite the same number being independently accepted as a valid upper bound under a separate UV relaxation. No capacity-frontier improvement or fixed-alphabet compactness theorem is established.",
